      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The town''s stations are now one Central Electric Station, and the whole
    city runs from its control desk. Every unit you add must be brought into step
    with the rest by hand. Watch the frequency: it is the grid''s heartbeat, and
    it tells you when you are short.'
